      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hi, I'm looking at our HACCP plan for our catering kitchen. Can you give me the specific temperature and time requirements for cooling down cooked poultry? I need to make sure we're preventing Clostridium perfringens growth correctly. thanks.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
