      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah that makes sense, it's basically the spores surviving and then just taking over once it cools. i'm trying to write up a training memo for the junior staff to help them visualize the threat so they take it seriously. how would you describe the way they operate in a way that emphasizes how they are basically hiding and then appearing out of nowhere once the temp drops?",
